    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what to do with myself anymore. its just so quiet in this apartment. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person looking back. it feels like the real me left when they did and now im just... wandering around in this shell. it's like i don't even exist.",
