      "content": "therapists just want to help you \"rebuild,\" but what if there's nothing left to build with? it feels like trying to fix a house that's already been burned to the ground. i'm just sitting here in the ashes. it feels so heavy and pointless to keep pretending there's a person here worth saving. it would be so much easier if the silence just became permanent.",
